      "message": "test(gate): a motion generator change runs the operations suite (#1068)\n\noperations.rs generates through the app layer, so it pins the motion\ngenerators end to end - but its Gate map named app modules only. A change\nunder crates/motion/src/multiaxis/ therefore passed quick while\nmultiaxis_rough_refuses_a_slot_the_cone_cannot_clear sat out; PR #1044 hit\nexactly that and only failed when a stacked merge ran the whole app list.\n\nName the generators the suite drives - machining2d, machining3d, drilling,\nfinishing3d, multiaxis, plunge_law - and pin both the map and the plan in an\nxtask unit test against this checkout: a change under\ncrates/motion/src/multiaxis/ selects app:operations.\n\nxtask/ is a process file, so PROCESS_VERSION goes 16 -> 17 (same number as\nthe other open process PRs; whichever merges second renumbers).\n\nFixes #1068",
